description:
Design a circuit that processes an 8-bit input signal and produces a 4-bit output. The output consists of two OR operations and two AND operations, applied separately to the first and last four bits of the input. Specifically, the first output bit indicates whether any of the first four bits are high, the second output bit signifies if all of the first four bits are high, the third output bit reflects whether any of the last four bits are high, and the fourth output bit confirms if all of the last four bits are high.
module top_module(
    input [7:0] in,
    output [3:0] out
);

