Implement an 8-bit Gray code converter. The module takes an 8-bit binary input and outputs its equivalent 8-bit Gray code representation. The conversion is achieved by using exclusive OR (XOR) operations between adjacent bits of the input signal, ensuring that only a single bit changes between successive values in the Gray code sequence.
module top_module(
    input [7:0] data_in,
    output reg [7:0] gray_out
);

