description:
Implement a 4-bit two's complement converter. The module takes a 4-bit input A, inverts all bits of A, and then adds 1 to the resulting value, producing a 4-bit output X that represents the two's complement of the input. This effectively allows for the conversion of a positive number to its negative equivalent in binary format.
module top_module(
    X,
